{"articleNo":"89762","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=89762&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[모집마감] [LINC사업단] Auto CAD 2급(2D) 강좌 개설 안내(9/23~10/5)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.08.30","hit":"4304","attachments":[{"name":"강의계획서.pptx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=89762&attachNo=72581"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">[모집마감]</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">[LINC사업단] Auto CAD 2급(2D) 강좌</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">개설 안내(9/23~10/5)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">LINC사업단에서는 취업 역량 강화를 위하여 아래와 같이 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Auto CAD 2급(2D) 기술</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0066ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">자격증</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 강좌를 개설하오니 관심있는 학생들의 많은 신청 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 신청자격 : 금오공과대학교 3,4학년 재학생(4학년 우선 선발. 단, 응용수학과 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2013. 9. 23.(월) ~ 10. 5.(토) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌일시 : 평일 18시 ~ 22시 [단, 10/5(토) 10~14시]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 시헙일시 : 2013. 10. 5(토) 15:00 ~ 16:30 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(시험 반드시 응시해야함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 강좌내용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 붙임1(강의계획서) 참고</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 선발기준 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">선착순 30명 모집</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(단, 30명 미만시 강좌 취소)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 제출서류 : Auto CAD 2급(2D) 기술자격증 강좌 신청서 1부, 통장사본 1부(제2금융권제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 신청장소 : 그린에너지관 401호(LINC 행정실)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -84.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 84.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 지원내용 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #ff66ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">수강료 무료(출석률 80%이상)<br>응시료 본인부담(5만원 -&gt; 자격증 취득시 전액 환급)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">◈ 기타사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 출석률 80%이상, 자격증 취득시 LINC사업단 마일리지 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #008000\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -90.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">☏ 478-7966</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2013. 08. 30.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">산학협력선도대학(LINC)사업단</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
